WEBVTT

00:01:34.630 --> 00:01:42.270
<b>7. The Burning Sea</b>

00:02:16.190 --> 00:02:17.940
<b>SUBMERGE</b>

00:02:18.980 --> 00:02:19.940
<b>SURFACE</b>

00:02:22.440 --> 00:02:23.130
<b>MANUAL</b>

00:02:23.130 --> 00:02:24.820
<b>AUTOMATIC</b>

00:03:15.430 --> 00:03:17.750
Enju? Kaede?

00:03:18.080 --> 00:03:18.940
Uh-oh.

00:03:19.040 --> 00:03:20.990
Huh? Makaba?

00:03:21.690 --> 00:03:22.760
Huh?

00:03:23.330 --> 00:03:26.710
What are you doing out here, Makaba?
And the antlings are here, too...

00:03:27.340 --> 00:03:29.820
Hey, Karin!
What do you think you're--

00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:31.780
Hm? What the--

00:03:36.850 --> 00:03:39.310
Hearing about Kei had us
a little rattled earlier.

00:03:39.410 --> 00:03:41.000
But our minds are made up!

00:03:41.100 --> 00:03:43.210
- We're gonna go rescue Yukimaru and Fena!
- We're gonna go rescue Yukimaru and Fena!

00:03:43.310 --> 00:03:47.150
Well, this was always too much for Yukimaru
to handle alone. I agree with these two!

00:03:47.520 --> 00:03:51.470
And that old bag is gonna pay for
kneeing me in my beautiful face!

00:03:51.570 --> 00:03:54.160
- Admit it, that's your main motivation.
- Um, actually...

00:03:55.030 --> 00:03:57.560
If we're all going, I think it
would be better if we went

00:03:57.660 --> 00:04:00.610
in the <i>Bonito</i> instead
of a <i>kohaya</i> boat.

00:04:02.110 --> 00:04:04.000
- That's true.
- I hadn't thought of that.

00:04:04.100 --> 00:04:05.170
Good point.

00:04:05.270 --> 00:04:08.680
Look, this is all well and good,
but there's the matter of Shitan...

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:10.600
Of all his annoying traits,
this one is--

00:04:10.700 --> 00:04:12.190
You called?

00:04:18.260 --> 00:04:20.020
Sh-Shitan?!

00:04:22.250 --> 00:04:23.770
E-Er...

00:04:24.210 --> 00:04:27.630
Shitan, hear me out!
I thought up a great plan!

00:04:27.730 --> 00:04:29.280
Do whatever you want.

00:04:29.800 --> 00:04:31.160
Me, I'm returning.

00:04:32.280 --> 00:04:33.700
Shitan...

00:04:39.400 --> 00:04:41.670
When you took up the bow,

00:04:42.350 --> 00:04:43.750
what made you do it?

00:04:45.310 --> 00:04:48.920
The bows I make are so stiff
that the arrows don't fly straight.

00:04:49.370 --> 00:04:51.430
No one would use them.

00:04:52.390 --> 00:04:54.950
But you did.

00:04:55.050 --> 00:04:57.430
And this is what you said to me:

00:04:58.600 --> 00:05:00.410
"This is amazing, Makaba.

00:05:00.510 --> 00:05:04.070
With a bow like this, I'll be able
to keep Yukimaru safe."

00:05:06.220 --> 00:05:08.070
Do you remember that?

00:05:08.860 --> 00:05:11.390
In all our countless battles,

00:05:11.490 --> 00:05:15.080
you've saved Yukimaru again and again
with your shots that come out of nowhere.

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:19.580
And Yukimaru saved my life,
and Tsubaki's.

00:05:21.180 --> 00:05:23.830
We became a circle.

00:05:24.630 --> 00:05:28.010
And then the twins and Karin
joined the circle.

00:05:28.110 --> 00:05:30.220
Our circle grew bigger.

00:05:31.350 --> 00:05:34.450
And then, Fena became
the newest person to join it.

00:05:35.530 --> 00:05:37.920
Our circle grew even bigger.

00:05:38.420 --> 00:05:39.350
I'm positive

00:05:39.710 --> 00:05:41.600
that that's a good thing.

00:05:45.050 --> 00:05:46.060
Shitan.

00:05:46.560 --> 00:05:49.610
We're going to go save
Yukimaru and Fena.

00:05:50.550 --> 00:05:53.610
But not because of our code
or some ulterior motive.

00:05:54.350 --> 00:05:56.320
It's because they're
our friends.

00:05:56.420 --> 00:05:58.620
So... we're going.

00:06:00.820 --> 00:06:01.820
Shitan.

00:06:12.910 --> 00:06:17.260
You know how Yukimaru gets himself
into trouble if we don't rein him in.

00:06:19.130 --> 00:06:22.520
Saving Yukimaru is your role.

00:06:24.130 --> 00:06:25.810
Let's all go together.

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:40.530
This person...

00:06:43.240 --> 00:06:44.980
...is my mother?

00:06:46.760 --> 00:06:48.460
Helena des Armoises.

00:06:49.690 --> 00:06:53.420
This is the only existing
image of her.

00:06:54.170 --> 00:06:55.800
I painted it.

00:06:56.410 --> 00:06:57.800
You painted this?

00:06:58.540 --> 00:07:01.180
Or rather, I am still in
the process of painting it.

00:07:02.510 --> 00:07:05.630
Based on hazy memories
from when I was a boy.

00:07:06.130 --> 00:07:09.250
But regardless of
the colors I apply,

00:07:09.350 --> 00:07:11.450
regardless of how
I wield my brush,

00:07:11.550 --> 00:07:15.050
I'm unable to capture
even half of her beauty.

00:07:15.860 --> 00:07:18.700
And those memories are fading.

00:07:19.830 --> 00:07:22.830
Bit by bit, she is
slipping away from me.

00:07:42.960 --> 00:07:47.350
You were in love
with my mother.

00:07:49.330 --> 00:07:50.360
Did she...

00:07:51.870 --> 00:07:53.360
Did she feel...

00:07:54.970 --> 00:07:56.970
...the same about you?

00:08:12.700 --> 00:08:14.110
What's the matter?

00:08:14.210 --> 00:08:15.380
It's the <i>Rumble Rose.</i>

00:08:15.940 --> 00:08:17.420
She's coming back.

00:08:33.450 --> 00:08:35.200
I have to know.

00:08:36.980 --> 00:08:37.980
Did Helena...

00:08:40.190 --> 00:08:42.620
Did Helena love me?

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:47.080
If she did, why did she
take you and--

00:08:50.160 --> 00:08:51.410
What's going on?!

00:09:05.490 --> 00:09:06.470
Helena...

00:09:11.530 --> 00:09:12.730
Lord Abel!

00:09:14.750 --> 00:09:16.020
What is it?

00:09:16.120 --> 00:09:17.480
The <i>Rumble Rose!</i>

00:09:18.120 --> 00:09:21.740
The <i>Rumble Rose</i> has turned around
and is firing on us!

00:09:22.270 --> 00:09:24.240
Fire!

00:09:34.090 --> 00:09:36.000
What are your orders, sir?

00:09:36.100 --> 00:09:37.250
Please remain here.

00:09:38.580 --> 00:09:40.610
I shall return soon.

00:09:50.800 --> 00:09:53.200
- What's her status?
- She's closing in.

00:09:53.300 --> 00:09:57.870
- Raise sails. Port rudder. Turn 45 degrees.
- Yes, sir!

00:10:00.900 --> 00:10:03.180
Come about!
Forty-five degrees!

00:10:03.280 --> 00:10:05.400
Come about!
Forty-five degrees!

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:07.780
Coming about!
Forty-five degrees!

00:10:10.400 --> 00:10:15.230
Their plan is probably to use covering fire
to get close enough to board us.

00:10:15.330 --> 00:10:18.230
Their ship has the edge in speed,
but nothing else.

00:10:18.330 --> 00:10:20.820
They're little more than a swarm of fruit
flies that buzz around a corpse.

00:10:20.920 --> 00:10:23.480
Load the Wellington cannon
with an explosive round.

00:10:23.580 --> 00:10:28.710
Sir? But that's a new weapon
that was developed to breach the walls

00:10:28.810 --> 00:10:30.090
of Saint-Malo.

00:10:30.190 --> 00:10:33.540
It's hardly something that's appropriate
for a lone, rickety pirate ship.

00:10:33.640 --> 00:10:35.140
Captain.

00:10:36.670 --> 00:10:38.570
Prepare the Wellington cannon!

00:10:38.850 --> 00:10:41.070
Load explosive round!

00:10:55.450 --> 00:10:58.710
Those two ships that had been sailing together
have begun to fight...

00:11:02.580 --> 00:11:04.720
The balance of power
has broken down?

00:11:05.730 --> 00:11:07.180
What caused it?

00:11:08.200 --> 00:11:09.630
What's changed?

00:11:11.300 --> 00:11:14.730
- The <i>Blue Giant</i> is coming about!
- Are they showing their flank?

00:11:15.420 --> 00:11:17.900
Looks like they want
a head-to-head fight.

00:11:18.000 --> 00:11:19.730
This should be fun.

00:11:20.220 --> 00:11:23.740
We'll show them what happens to
anyone who makes an enemy of us.

00:11:33.570 --> 00:11:36.690
What the heck is that big cannon?
I've never seen anything like it.

00:11:36.790 --> 00:11:39.680
We're ready to fire.
I suggest you brace yourself.

00:11:40.910 --> 00:11:43.240
Full speed ahead!
We're going in!

00:11:43.340 --> 00:11:45.750
FIRE!

00:11:57.010 --> 00:11:57.730
Ow!

00:11:58.430 --> 00:11:59.980
What's going on?!

00:12:04.690 --> 00:12:06.360
What's happening?!

00:12:07.230 --> 00:12:08.860
It can't be...

00:12:28.580 --> 00:12:30.290
Abel...

00:12:40.300 --> 00:12:41.310
Fena!

00:12:58.330 --> 00:13:03.110
As I thought, it's far too powerful
to be used against a ship.

00:13:03.210 --> 00:13:04.750
It makes a mess of the sea.

00:13:04.850 --> 00:13:07.990
The Gospel of Matthew.
Chapter 9, verse 16.

00:13:08.090 --> 00:13:09.090
Sir?

00:13:10.700 --> 00:13:13.700
Wasn't that one about old wine?

00:13:14.170 --> 00:13:18.540
Would you care to join me for a drink
tonight, my good commander?

00:13:42.510 --> 00:13:43.710
Fena...

00:13:56.700 --> 00:13:59.160
Look at me, Yukimaru.

00:14:03.270 --> 00:14:06.410
Do you know why
you cannot best me?

00:14:09.720 --> 00:14:12.670
It is because your heart is timid.

00:14:14.090 --> 00:14:16.180
You are afraid of me.

00:14:16.740 --> 00:14:20.180
That fear causes your limbs to stiffen,
which slows your movements.

00:14:21.070 --> 00:14:24.250
Your weakness of heart
is your fatal flaw.

00:14:24.350 --> 00:14:27.820
Whenever you feel afraid, slash through it
with the utmost calm.

00:14:28.900 --> 00:14:30.230
You must conquer yourself.

00:14:31.100 --> 00:14:32.480
And also,

00:14:33.210 --> 00:14:37.440
constantly think about what must
be done at any given moment.

00:14:55.370 --> 00:14:58.010
There was no hesitation.
With a single shot...

00:14:58.630 --> 00:15:00.800
<i>I'm afraid I can't do that.</i>

00:15:00.900 --> 00:15:04.460
<i>Apparently, we need both the girl
</i>and<i> the coordinates.</i>

00:15:04.760 --> 00:15:07.390
Their targets are
the coordinates and Fena.

00:15:07.490 --> 00:15:11.490
That being the case, they would never
sink a ship that Fena was aboard.

00:15:41.710 --> 00:15:42.970
It's burning...

00:15:44.320 --> 00:15:45.470
That ship...

00:15:46.680 --> 00:15:47.980
It's burning!

00:16:18.710 --> 00:16:20.350
<i>Red...</i>

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:24.180
<i>Red demons...</i>

00:16:27.620 --> 00:16:28.680
Are you all right?

00:16:33.640 --> 00:16:35.330
Do you feel seasick?

00:16:35.430 --> 00:16:36.570
What's the matter?

00:16:47.560 --> 00:16:50.120
Miss Fena! You have to escape!

00:17:00.830 --> 00:17:03.180
Blue demons...

00:17:03.730 --> 00:17:05.780
Did that flash of light
scare her out of her mind?

00:17:05.880 --> 00:17:07.160
Oh, brother...

00:17:08.560 --> 00:17:10.310
Stay away!

00:17:12.650 --> 00:17:14.690
You were there, too...
I saw!

00:17:17.300 --> 00:17:18.330
No...

00:17:20.390 --> 00:17:22.140
- No!
- What on earth?

00:17:22.230 --> 00:17:23.910
I think she's gone crazy.

00:17:24.260 --> 00:17:26.290
What's all the commotion?

00:17:26.390 --> 00:17:29.160
Lord Abel's guest
seems to be in shock.

00:17:31.600 --> 00:17:33.170
His "guest"?

00:17:34.010 --> 00:17:37.200
She's just one of his prostitutes...
Don't make me laugh.

00:17:38.250 --> 00:17:39.670
Throw her in the brig!

00:17:40.110 --> 00:17:41.570
But what about Lord Abel?

00:17:41.670 --> 00:17:46.180
This is my ship! I can't have
a crazy person running loose!

00:17:46.680 --> 00:17:50.000
I'll take full responsibility.
Do as you're ordered!

00:17:50.100 --> 00:17:51.180
Yes, sir...

00:17:53.050 --> 00:17:54.690
Save me...

00:17:56.720 --> 00:17:59.690
Save me, Yukimaru!

00:18:00.060 --> 00:18:02.450
Yukimaru!

00:18:16.870 --> 00:18:18.250
Yukimaru!

00:18:19.700 --> 00:18:21.630
Stay put right there.

00:18:25.380 --> 00:18:26.800
We've been boarded!

00:18:31.050 --> 00:18:32.160
Yukimaru!

00:18:32.260 --> 00:18:35.930
Don't worry. If anyone
lays a finger on you...

00:18:44.850 --> 00:18:46.400
...I'll kill them without mercy!

00:18:47.200 --> 00:18:49.800
Wh-What are you waiting for?!
Shoot him!

00:18:49.900 --> 00:18:51.490
We'll hit Lord Abel's guest!

00:18:52.240 --> 00:18:53.830
Do it anyway! Shoot him!

00:19:16.140 --> 00:19:18.270
Y-You were--

00:19:26.560 --> 00:19:28.160
Yukimaru!

00:19:28.370 --> 00:19:30.060
Yukimaru! Yukimaru!

00:19:30.160 --> 00:19:31.370
Please!

00:19:31.860 --> 00:19:33.680
Yukimaru! Yukimaru!

00:19:33.780 --> 00:19:36.160
Fena... Run...

00:19:36.910 --> 00:19:37.910
Yukimaru...!

00:19:39.700 --> 00:19:42.170
Escort the lady to my quarters.
Be gentle.

00:19:42.650 --> 00:19:43.550
And the boarder?

00:19:45.800 --> 00:19:47.050
Kill him.

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:53.060
Stay back!

00:20:32.850 --> 00:20:34.600
There's no end to these guys!
Makaba!

00:20:39.970 --> 00:20:41.350
Makaba!

00:20:49.400 --> 00:20:51.260
It's a smoke screen!
Stay calm!

00:20:51.360 --> 00:20:53.020
Put it out!
